        Locked out of your office, storefront, or commercial property? Every minute of downtime costs your business. 1st Capital Locksmith provides fast, professional office lockout service throughout Delaware â€” 6 days a week, all commercial door hardware, no unnecessary disruption.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <a
          href="tel:3027350050"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-bold text-base md:text-lg hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
