          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Secure After Terminated Employees</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Delaware's Commercial Lockout Specialists</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6 leading-snug">
            Professional Office Lockout Service for Delaware Businesses
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A business lockout is a different situation from a residential one â€” the stakes are immediate and financial. A retail store that cannot open at 9 AM loses customers. An office that cannot access its space before a client meeting loses credibility. A warehouse that cannot unlock its doors delays an entire day's operations. 1st Capital Locksmith treats commercial lockouts with the urgency they deserve.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Our technicians are experienced with the full range of commercial door hardware â€” not just residential pin tumbler locks. Commercial buildings use mortise locksets, rim cylinders, cylindrical locksets with restricted cores, electronic keypad entry systems, and panic bar hardware. We carry the tools and knowledge to open them professionally.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We serve businesses across <a href="/service-areas/dover-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Dover</a>, <a href="/service-areas/smyrna-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Smyrna</a>, <a href="/service-areas/milford-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Milford</a>, <a href="/service-areas/harrington-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Harrington</a>, <a href="/service-areas/camden-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Camden</a>, <a href="/service-areas/felton-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Felton</a>, and all of Kent County. Call (302) 735-0050 and we are on the way immediately.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-[#F8F8F5] aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
